  27:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h ****  *
  28:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** The NonPersistentMemoryPlannerShim enables TFLM to work with an external tooling
  29:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** that can plan the offset of each non persistent buffer for the Model within the
  30:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** TFLM arena.
  31:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** 
  32:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** If the NonPersistentMemoryPlannerShim is used, then the final binary does not
  33:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** have any of the symbols associated with the GreedyMemoryPlanner which results in
  34:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** a reduced memory footprint.
  35:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** 
  36:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** Additionally, the offline planning of the non-persistent buffers can be used to
  37:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** have a more efficient utilization compared to the GreedyMemoryPlanner.
  38:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** 
  39:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/non_persistent_buffer_planner_shim.h **** For example, consider the following hypothetical model:
